    },
    {
      "text": "On a plate break up the pork rinds into small pieces.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-puppy-chow/#wprm-recipe-54259-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Puppy-Chow-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a bowl, stir together the coconut oil, almond butter, and cocoa powder until combined well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-puppy-chow/#wprm-recipe-54259-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Puppy-Chow-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the small pork rind pieces to a bowl and drizzle the chocolate almond butter mixture on top. Stir to fully coat the pork rinds.",
