      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Puppy-Chow-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer the chocolate covered pork rinds to a Ziploc bag.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-puppy-chow/#wprm-recipe-54259-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Puppy-Chow-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the low-carb brown sugar replacement.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-chocolate-puppy-chow/#wprm-recipe-54259-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Keto-Puppy-Chow-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shake well to fully coat the pork rinds.",
